{"seq":3,"slug":"subdomain-classification","title":"子域分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/strategic-design/subdomain-classification","wordCount":984,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"子域分类\">子域分类</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>子域（Subdomain）是业务领域的自然分区，反映了企业在不同业务方向上的能力分布。领域驱动设计将子域分为三类：核心域（Core Domain）、支撑域（Supporting Subdomain）和通用域（Generic Subdomain）。这个分类决定了资源投入策略——不是所有代码都值得同等对待。</p>\n<p>核心域是企业的竞争优势所在，必须投入最优秀的人才和最大的精力。支撑域为核心域提供必要支持，但本身不构成差异化优势。通用域是所有企业都需要但无差异化价值的能力，通常可以购买或采用开源方案。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 业务领域&#10;        A[核心域&lt;br/&gt;竞争优势&lt;br/&gt;最大投入]&#10;        B[支撑域&lt;br/&gt;业务必需&lt;br/&gt;适度投入]&#10;        C[通用域&lt;br/&gt;行业通用&lt;br/&gt;最小投入]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; D[自研 + 顶尖团队]&#10;    B --&gt; E[内部开发 / 低代码]&#10;    C --&gt; F[购买 / 开源 / SaaS]\">graph TB\n    subgraph 业务领域\n        A[核心域&lt;br/&gt;竞争优势&lt;br/&gt;最大投入]\n        B[支撑域&lt;br/&gt;业务必需&lt;br/&gt;适度投入]\n        C[通用域&lt;br/&gt;行业通用&lt;br/&gt;最小投入]\n    end\n    A --&gt; D[自研 + 顶尖团队]\n    B --&gt; E[内部开发 / 低代码]\n    C --&gt; F[购买 / 开源 / SaaS]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>核心域</th>\n<th>支撑域</th>\n<th>通用域</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>业务价值</td>\n<td>直接创造竞争优势</td>\n<td>支持核心业务运转</td>\n<td>基础设施级能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂度</td>\n<td>高，需深度领域知识</td>\n<td>中，有一定业务规则</td>\n<td>低到中，规则标准化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变更频率</td>\n<td>高，持续演进</td>\n<td>中，相对稳定</td>\n<td>低，很少变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人才投入</td>\n<td>最优秀的领域专家 + 工程师</td>\n<td>合格的开发团队</td>\n<td>最少人力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现策略</td>\n<td>精心设计，DDD 全套</td>\n<td>适度设计，简化 DDD</td>\n<td>购买 / 集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>差异化程度</td>\n<td>同行之间差异巨大</td>\n<td>有一些差异</td>\n<td>几乎无差异</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"核心域识别\">核心域识别</h2><p>核心域是企业存在的理由。识别核心域需要回答一个根本问题：<strong>如果这个能力被竞争对手完全复制，企业是否会失去竞争优势？</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 核心域识别框架&#10;interface CoreDomainAssessment {&#10;  capability: string;&#10;  differentiationScore: 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 | 5; // 差异化程度&#10;  strategicImportance: 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 | 5; // 战略重要性&#10;  complexityLevel: &#39;low&#39; | &#39;medium&#39; | &#39;high&#39;;&#10;  competitorParity: boolean; // 竞争对手是否已有同等能力&#10;}&#10;&#10;function classifyDomain(assessment: CoreDomainAssessment): DomainType {&#10;  const { differentiationScore, strategicImportance, competitorParity } = assessment;&#10;&#10;  if (differentiationScore &gt;= 4 &amp;&amp; strategicImportance &gt;= 4 &amp;&amp; !competitorParity) {&#10;    return &#39;core&#39;;&#10;  }&#10;  if (strategicImportance &gt;= 3 &amp;&amp; differentiationScore &lt; 4) {&#10;    return &#39;supporting&#39;;&#10;  }&#10;  return &#39;generic&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;type DomainType = &#39;core&#39; | &#39;supporting&#39; | &#39;generic&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 核心域识别框架</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CoreDomainAssessment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  capability</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  differentiationScore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 差异化程度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  strategicImportance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 战略重要性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  complexityLevel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'low'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'medium'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'high'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  competitorParity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 竞争对手是否已有同等能力</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> classifyDomain</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">assessment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CoreDomainAssessment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DomainType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">differentiationScore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">strategicImportance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">competitorParity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> assessment;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (differentiationScore </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> strategicImportance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">competitorParity) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'core'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (strategicImportance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> differentiationScore </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'supporting'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'generic'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DomainType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'core'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'supporting'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'generic'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>以电商平台为例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 电商平台子域分类&#10;const ecommerceDomains = {&#10;  core: [&#10;    &#39;个性化推荐引擎&#39;, // 这是淘宝和拼多多的核心差异&#10;    &#39;供应链智能调度&#39;, // 京东的核心竞争力&#10;    &#39;社交裂变营销&#39;, // 拼多多的核心壁垒&#10;  ],&#10;  supporting: [&#10;    &#39;订单管理&#39;, // 必须有，但不是核心差异&#10;    &#39;商品管理&#39;, // 支撑业务运转&#10;    &#39;客服工单系统&#39;, // 业务必需但非差异化&#10;    &#39;商家入驻审核&#39;, // 支撑平台运营&#10;  ],&#10;  generic: [&#10;    &#39;用户认证与授权&#39;, // 所有系统都需要&#10;    &#39;支付网关集成&#39;, // 标准化能力&#10;    &#39;短信/邮件通知&#39;, // 通用基础设施&#10;    &#39;文件存储服务&#39;, // 完全通用&#10;  ],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 电商平台子域分类</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ecommerceDomains</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  core: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '个性化推荐引擎'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 这是淘宝和拼多多的核心差异</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '供应链智能调度'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 京东的核心竞争力</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '社交裂变营销'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 拼多多的核心壁垒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  supporting: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '订单管理'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 必须有，但不是核心差异</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '商品管理'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 支撑业务运转</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '客服工单系统'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 业务必需但非差异化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '商家入驻审核'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 支撑平台运营</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  generic: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '用户认证与授权'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 所有系统都需要</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '支付网关集成'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 标准化能力</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '短信/邮件通知'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 通用基础设施</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '文件存储服务'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 完全通用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>核心域的一个重要特征是<strong>随时间漂移</strong>。今天的核心域可能因为行业成熟而变成通用域，而新的技术突破可能催生新的核心域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"投资策略与资源分配\">投资策略与资源分配</h2><p>子域分类的直接产出是差异化的投资策略。在有限的资源下，错误的分配方式会导致核心能力建设不足。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 投资分配&#10;        A[核心域&lt;br/&gt;60-70% 预算] --&gt; D[DDD 全套模式&lt;br/&gt;领域专家深度参与&lt;br/&gt;持续重构]&#10;        B[支撑域&lt;br/&gt;20-25% 预算] --&gt; E[简化 DDD&lt;br/&gt;合格团队&lt;br/&gt;适度设计]&#10;        C[通用域&lt;br/&gt;5-15% 预算] --&gt; F[购买 SaaS&lt;br/&gt;开源方案&lt;br/&gt;最小维护]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 投资分配\n        A[核心域&lt;br/&gt;60-70% 预算] --&gt; D[DDD 全套模式&lt;br/&gt;领域专家深度参与&lt;br/&gt;持续重构]\n        B[支撑域&lt;br/&gt;20-25% 预算] --&gt; E[简化 DDD&lt;br/&gt;合格团队&lt;br/&gt;适度设计]\n        C[通用域&lt;br/&gt;5-15% 预算] --&gt; F[购买 SaaS&lt;br/&gt;开源方案&lt;br/&gt;最小维护]\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 每种子域的技术决策框架&#10;interface DomainInvestmentStrategy {&#10;  domainType: DomainType;&#10;  architecture: string;&#10;  testingStrategy: string;&#10;  teamComposition: string;&#10;  buildVsBuy: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const strategies: Record&lt;DomainType, DomainInvestmentStrategy&gt; = {&#10;  core: {&#10;    domainType: &#39;core&#39;,&#10;    architecture: &#39;充血模型 + 事件驱动 + CQRS&#39;,&#10;    testingStrategy: &#39;全面的领域层单测 + 集成测试 + 契约测试&#39;,&#10;    teamComposition: &#39;领域专家 + 资深工程师 + 产品经理紧密协作&#39;,&#10;    buildVsBuy: &#39;100% 自研&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  supporting: {&#10;    domainType: &#39;supporting&#39;,&#10;    architecture: &#39;简单分层 + 事务脚本或轻量 DDD&#39;,&#10;    testingStrategy: &#39;关键路径集成测试 + 核心逻辑单测&#39;,&#10;    teamComposition: &#39;合格的全栈开发团队&#39;,&#10;    buildVsBuy: &#39;自研为主，可用低代码平台加速&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  generic: {&#10;    domainType: &#39;generic&#39;,&#10;    architecture: &#39;直接集成第三方服务&#39;,&#10;    testingStrategy: &#39;集成测试 + 契约测试&#39;,&#10;    teamComposition: &#39;最少维护人员&#39;,&#10;    buildVsBuy: &#39;优先购买 / 开源，仅在必要时薄封装&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 每种子域的技术决策框架</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DomainInvestmentStrategy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  domainType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DomainType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  architecture</span><span style=