class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    domainType: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'core'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    architecture: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'充血模型 + 事件驱动 + CQRS'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    testingStrategy: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'全面的领域层单测 + 集成测试 + 契约测试'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    teamComposition: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'领域专家 + 资深工程师 + 产品经理紧密协作'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    buildVsBuy: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'100% 自研'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  supporting: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    domainType: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'supporting'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    architecture: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'简单分层 + 事务脚本或轻量 DDD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    testingStrategy: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'关键路径集成测试 + 核心逻辑单测'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    teamComposition: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'合格的全栈开发团队'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    buildVsBuy: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'自研为主，可用低代码平台加速'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  generic: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    domainType: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'generic'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    architecture: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'直接集成第三方服务'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    testingStrategy: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'集成测试 + 契约测试'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    teamComposition: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'最少维护人员'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    buildVsBuy: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'优先购买 / 开源，仅在必要时薄封装'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一个常见的反模式是<strong>通用域镀金</strong>——在用户认证、文件上传等通用能力上花费大量精力自研，结果既不比成熟方案更好，又消耗了本应投入核心域的资源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"子域边界与限界上下文的关系\">子域边界与限界上下文的关系</h2><p>子域是问题空间的概念，限界上下文是解决方案空间的概念。理想情况下，一个子域对应一个限界上下文，但现实中两者的映射并非总是一对一。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 理想映射：一个子域 → 一个限界上下文&#10;// 子域: 个性化推荐 → 限界上下文: RecommendationContext&#10;&#10;// 现实中的多种映射情况&#10;type DomainToContextMapping =&#10;  | { type: &#39;one_to_one&#39;; subdomain: string; context: string }&#10;  | { type: &#39;one_to_many&#39;; subdomain: string; contexts: string[] }&#10;  | { type: &#39;many_to_one&#39;; subdomains: string[]; context: string };&#10;&#10;// 一对多：一个复杂子域拆分为多个上下文&#10;// 例：订单子域 → 订单创建上下文 + 订单履约上下文 + 订单退款上下文&#10;&#10;// 多对一：多个简单子域合并为一个上下文（初期常见）&#10;// 例：通知子域 + 日志子域 → 通用基础设施上下文\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 理想映射：一个子域 → 一个限界上下文</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 子域: 个性化推荐 → 限界上下文: RecommendationContext</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 现实中的多种映射情况</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DomainToContextMapping</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'one_to_one'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">subdomain</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'one_to_many'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">subdomain</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">contexts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'many_to_one'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">subdomains</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 一对多：一个复杂子域拆分为多个上下文</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 例：订单子域 → 订单创建上下文 + 订单履约上下文 + 订单退款上下文</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 多对一：多个简单子域合并为一个上下文（初期常见）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 例：通知子域 + 日志子域 → 通用基础设施上下文</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>映射类型</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一对一</td>\n<td>子域边界清晰</td>\n<td>理想状态，优先追求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一对多</td>\n<td>子域过于复杂</td>\n<td>确保拆分后各上下文仍有内聚性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多对一</td>\n<td>子域过于简单</td>\n<td>早期可接受，随业务增长逐步拆分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多对多</td>\n<td>边界混乱</td>\n<td>需要重新审视子域划分</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"子域评估工作坊\">子域评估工作坊</h2><p>在实践中，子域分类通常通过工作坊形式完成。参与者包括领域专家、产品经理和技术负责人。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 子域评估卡片&#10;interface SubdomainCard {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  description: string;&#10;  businessCapabilities: string[];&#10;&#10;  // 评估维度 (1-5 分)&#10;  scores: {&#10;    differentiation: number; // 差异化：这个能力让我们与众不同吗？&#10;    strategicImportance: number; // 战略性：这个能力对业务战略重要吗？&#10;    complexity: number; // 复杂度：实现这个能力有多复杂？&#10;    changeFrequency: number; // 变更频率：这个领域的规则多久变一次？&#10;    dataVolatility: number; // 数据波动：相关数据的变化频率？&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  classification?: DomainType;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 评估规则&#10;function evaluateSubdomain(card: SubdomainCard): DomainType {&#10;  const { differentiation, strategicImportance } = card.scores;&#10;&#10;  if (differentiation &gt;= 4 &amp;&amp; strategicImportance &gt;= 4) return &#39;core&#39;;&#10;  if (strategicImportance &gt;= 3) return &#39;supporting&#39;;&#10;  return &#39;generic&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 工作坊流程：&#10;// 1. 列出所有业务能力（头脑风暴）&#10;// 2. 聚类为候选子域&#10;// 3. 填写评估卡片（全体打分）&#10;// 4. 分类讨论并达成共识&#10;// 5. 映射到限界上下文&#10;// 6. 制定投资策略\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 子域评估卡片</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SubdomainCard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  businessCapabilities</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 评估维度 (1-5 分)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  scores</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    differentiation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 差异化：这个能力让我们与众不同吗？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    strategicImportance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 战略性：这个能力对业务战略重要吗？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    complexity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 复杂度：实现这个能力有多复杂？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    changeFrequency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 变更频率：这个领域的规则多久变一次？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    dataVolatility</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 数据波动：相关数据的变化频率？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  classification</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DomainType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 评估规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> evaluateSubdomain</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">card</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SubdomainCard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DomainType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">differentiation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">strategicImportance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> card.scores;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (differentiation </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> strategicImportance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'core'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (strategicImportance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'supporting'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'generic'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 工作坊流程：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1. 列出所有业务能力（头脑风暴）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2. 聚类为候选子域</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 3. 填写评估卡片（全体打分）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 4. 分类讨论并达成共识</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 5. 映射到限界上下文</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 6. 制定投资策略</span></span></code></pre></div><p>工作坊的关键产出是一张<strong>子域地图</strong>，标注每个子域的分类、负责团队和技术策略。这张地图应该定期（每季度或半年）回顾更新。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((子域分类))&#10;    核心域&#10;      竞争优势&#10;      最大投入&#10;      DDD 全套&#10;    支撑域&#10;      业务必需&#10;      适度投入&#10;      简化设计&#10;    通用域&#10;      行业通用&#10;      最小投入&#10;      购买优先&#10;    评估方法&#10;      差异化分析&#10;      战略重要性&#10;      评估工作坊&#10;    与限界上下文&#10;      问题空间 vs 解决方案空间&#10;      理想一对一映射\">mindmap\n  root((子域分类))\n    核心域\n      竞争优势\n      最大投入\n      DDD 全套\n    支撑域\n      业务必需\n      适度投入\n      简化设计\n    通用域\n      行业通用\n      最小投入\n      购买优先\n    评估方法\n      差异化分析\n      战略重要性\n      评估工作坊\n    与限界上下文\n      问题空间 vs 解决方案空间\n      理想一对一映射</pre><ul>\n<li>子域分类（核心/支撑/通用）决定了资源投入的优先级</li>\n<li>核心域是企业竞争优势所在，必须投入最优秀的人才自研</li>\n<li>通用域应优先购买或使用开源方案，避免&quot;通用域镀金&quot;反模式</li>\n<li>子域是问题空间概念，限界上下文是解决方案空间概念，两者理想一对一映射</li>\n<li>子域分类不是静态的，需要定期回顾——今天的核心域可能变成明天的通用域</li>\n<li>通过工作坊形式完成子域评估，产出子域地图指导技术投资决策</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"子域分类","id":"子域分类"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心域识别","id":"核心域识别"},{"level":2,"text":"投资策略与资源分配","id":"投资策略与资源分配"},{"level":2,"text":"子域边界与限界上下文的关系","id":"子域边界与限界上下文的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"子域评估工作坊","id":"子域评估工作坊"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"上下文映射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/strategic-design/context-mapping"},"next":{"title":"统一语言","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/strategic-design/ubiquitous-language"}}